WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
Inside every person, say the
rabbis, two inclinations pull:

2
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.280
one good, one selfish.

3
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:10.610
You might expect the
selfish one to be pure evil.

4
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:14.160
Yet a midrash says that without
it, no one would build a house,

5
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.250
marry, or have children.

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.180
So what are humans for?

7
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:21.440
What does Judaism say
the point of a life is?

8
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:25.840
In this mission, you'll weigh up the
different purposes Jews give for a life.

9
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.390
Then you'll see how the rabbis say the
selfish inclination should be handled.

10
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:35.080
Your mission: find out what Judaism
says the point of a human life is.
